{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51147","headline":"题雷琴（二首） 二 · 宋之问","name":"题雷琴（二首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛水多清泚，崧高有白云。\n圣朝容隐逸，时得咏南薫。\n（《古今图书集成》）（宋姚宽《西溪丛语》卷上云：「长兄伯声云：洛中董氏蓄雷琴一张，中题云〖引前四言诗，略〗。\n状其声也。\n其外漆下隐有朱书云〖引後五言诗，略〗。\n此诗见《宋之问集》。\n」据此，应仅後首爲宋之问作。\n又此爲後人取宋诗题雷琴此拟题爲《题雷琴》，误。\n雷琴因雷威所制而得名，雷威爲大历间人，宋之问不及见。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}